# The spilled-ale scene at the bar, for `persona converse events=`: what happens at which turn.
# turn | what happens (the speakers of that turn and the next react to it; the frame judge sees it)
0 | A drunk patron stumbles into Lena and her tray of ale crashes, soaking her blouse.
2 | Kael leaps to his feet, furious, his hand on his sword hilt, glaring at the drunk.
4 | Lena grabs Kael's arm and steps between him and the drunk.
6 | The drunk raises his hands and backs away into the crowd.
8 | Kael and Lena burst out laughing; she wrings ale out of her braid.
11 | They sit close together by the hearth, foreheads almost touching.
